WEBVTT

00:00:11.987 --> 00:00:13.330
<v><b>W:</b></v> Are you ready to order?

00:00:13.496 --> 00:00:14.253
<v><b>M:</b></v> Yes, please.

00:00:21.943 --> 00:00:23.300
<v><b>W:</b></v> Can I get you something to start with?

00:00:24.121 --> 00:00:24.672
<v><b>M:</b></v> OK.

00:00:24.673 --> 00:00:26.270
Do we want starters?

00:00:35.317 --> 00:00:35.879
No, thank you.

00:00:45.054 --> 00:00:46.778
I’d like the tuna.

00:00:54.238 --> 00:00:57.300
<v><b>W:</b></v> Would you like that with salad or chips?

00:00:57.598 --> 00:00:58.716
<v><b>M:</b></v> Salad, please.

00:01:06.919 --> 00:01:07.598
<v><b>W:</b></v> And for you?

00:01:08.389 --> 00:01:09.883
<v><b>I:</b></v> I’ll have the steak, please.

00:01:17.832 --> 00:01:19.155
<v><b>W:</b></v> How would you like your steak?

00:01:19.429 --> 00:01:21.275
Rare, medium, or well done?

00:01:21.924 --> 00:01:22.398
<v><b>I:</b></v> Rare.

00:01:32.803 --> 00:01:37.874
<v><b>W:</b></v> The tuna for you, the steak for you.

00:01:38.547 --> 00:01:39.797
The other dishes are coming.

00:01:40.198 --> 00:01:41.160
<v><b>M:</b></v> Excuse me.

00:01:48.533 --> 00:01:50.852
I asked for salad, not chips.

00:01:59.426 --> 00:02:00.051
<v><b>W:</b></v> Oh, I’m sorry.

00:02:00.496 --> 00:02:02.532
No problem, I’ll change it.

00:02:05.037 --> 00:02:05.730
<v><b>I:</b></v> Excuse me.

00:02:13.347 --> 00:02:13.782
<v><b>W:</b></v> Yes?

00:02:14.475 --> 00:02:17.200
<v><b>I:</b></v> I asked for my steak rare, and this is medium.

00:02:29.568 --> 00:02:30.940
<v><b>W:</b></v> I’m really sorry.

00:02:31.345 --> 00:02:32.839
I’ll take it back to the kitchen.

00:02:37.903 --> 00:02:39.148
<v><b>M:</b></v> Can we have the bill, please?

00:02:46.496 --> 00:02:47.092
<v><b>W:</b></v> Of course.

00:02:52.165 --> 00:02:53.903
<v><b>M:</b></v> I think there’s a mistake here.

00:03:01.462 --> 00:03:03.645
I had the salad, not chips.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:12.293
And Izzy had the steak.

00:03:20.154 --> 00:03:21.476
<v><b>W:</b></v> I’m very sorry.

00:03:21.627 --> 00:03:22.501
I’ll change that.